#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-pix32v6.rst:6
#: 47b6dffe0122493eb3671437e10d49bd
msgid "Pix32v6 is a variant of the Holybro Pixhawk 6C. It is comprised of a separate flight controller and carrier board which are connected by a 100 pin connector. It is designed for those pilots who need a high power, flexible and customizable flight control system."
